      "problem": "If $y=-2,$ then $|3-{y}^{4}|+|y|-8=${{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "We substitute $y=-2$ and then evaluate the absolute values before we simplify the rest of the expression:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|3-{y}^{4}|+|y|-8 & = \\\\ |3-(-2)^{4}|+|-2|-8 & = \\\\ |3-16|+|-2|-8 & = \\\\ |-13|+|-2|-8 & = \\\\ 13+2-8 & = \\\\ 7 & \\end{aligned}\n$$",
